blurb: The board held its first FY2025 budget workshop, where the Superintendent detailed
  a $69.5M proposal shaped by the loss of federal COVID funds. The meeting included
  extensive presentations on the district's Multi-Tiered Systems of Support (MTSS)
  and featured public comment urging the board to retain a high school art teacher
  position slated for elimination.
